# Renderer overlay regression test (see docs/REPLAY.md): F1 settings menu (3 tabs),
# Ctrl+L dialog log with captured monologue lines, F2 split-screen, hotspot markers.
# Navigation only - no setting is changed.
#! threshold 06_hotspots 0.12   (hotspot markers pulse with wall-clock time)
wait video 60
1000 tap Escape
wait menu 60
1500 click 60 553
wait room x/006 30
1500 click 114 566
+2000 tap Escape
wait room l/001 30
3000 click 400 300
+2500 click 400 300
+2500 click 400 300
+2500 click 400 300
+2500 click 400 300
+11000 expect hotspots 15
+0 move 400 120
+500 tap F1
+800 shotfull 01_f1_display
+0 tap Tab
+600 shotfull 02_f1_postfx
+0 tap Tab
+600 shotfull 03_f1_assets_text
+0 tap Escape
+600 key down Left Ctrl
+50 tap L
+100 key up Left Ctrl
+800 shotfull 04_dialog_log
+0 tap Escape
+600 tap F2
+400 move 300 300
+800 shotfull 05_f2_split
+0 tap F2
+800 key down Space
+700 shotfull 06_hotspots
+0 key up Space
+600 shotfull 07_clean
+500 quit
